@startuml
hide empty description
[*] --> Initialized: "Manage Access" selected
Initialized --> Target: User selected
Target --> Context: Object family selected
Context --> Instance: Object instance selected

Target --> Confirm: Change user's tier
Context --> Confirm: Change permissions
Instance --> Confirm: Change permissions

Initialized --> Cancel: Close panel
Target --> Cancel: Cancel changes
Context --> Cancel: Cancel changes
Instance --> Cancel: Cancel changes

Confirm --> Cancel: Invalid changes detected
Confirm --> End: Changes accepted

Initialized: A modification form has been created.

Target: Allows for changes to the user's admin tier.
state "Target Chosen" as Target

Context: Allows for creation permissions modification\nand object instance selection.
state "Context Chosen" as Context

Instance: Allows for changes to permissions to\nsee, use, modify, and delete\nthe chosen object by the chosen user.
state "Instance Chosen" as Instance

End: The form passed SysMon's internal checks\nand the changes within are introduced into the system.
state "Changes introduced" as End

Confirm: Allows the administrator\nto review the changes before committing.
state "Pending Review" as Confirm

Cancel: The operation has been cancelled\nand the form is marked for deletion.
state "Operation Aborted" as Cancel

@enduml